<title>FRANCE: VIA Banque boosted by Phenix deal.</title>
<headline>VIA Banque boosted by Phenix deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Via Banque were the biggest risers on a weaker French market on Tuesday after a deal between AGF and Dutch ABN Amro Holding NV on Banque du Phenix.</p>
<p>&quot;This deal is rekindling interest in small banks,&quot; a broker said.</p>
<p>VIA was up 5.42 percent at 175 francs at 1023 GMT, after having hit a high of 182 francs.</p>
</text>
